WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:05.610
Speaker 1: Let's talk today about virtue signaling
and its cousin dog whistling.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:09.600
I get so many emails about this and it really
is a good opportunity to talk about it.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.410
This is these are both terms that are often
used.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:19.890
You may have heard this term being used to
criticize people on the left for their activism

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:23.260
or their organizing their efforts.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:26.570
Virtue signaling the left are virtue signals.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:28.590
What does that actually mean?

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:34.059
And by the way, it is really the right that
participates in a lot of this virtue signaling,

00:00:34.059 --> 00:00:37.329
which I don't think will come as a surprise
to you at this point.

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:43.289
Virtue signaling means when you express a
moral or an ethical stance or a political

00:00:43.289 --> 00:00:51.340
stance, it can even be in order to gain approval
from others and signal your virtue.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:56.989
Virtue signaling means I express an opinion
which I may or may not really hold, which

00:00:56.989 --> 00:01:03.309
I may or may not really even understand, in
order to signal to others that I am saying

00:01:03.309 --> 00:01:09.220
the right things so that they then will have
a better opinion of me.

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:11.030
It can take many forms.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:18.380
It could be you post things to social media
about your charitable donations or your activism

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:20.740
in order to signal your virtue.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:28.570
You publicly expressed outrage over some issue
in order to appear socially conscious, or

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:31.460
that you're on board, or whatever the case
may be.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:39.460
Now, it's really important to understand that
engaging in activism and expressing values

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:46.119
is not inherently bad, that that's not the
point of virtue signaling as a pejorative.

00:01:46.119 --> 00:01:53.579
When the signals, when the actions are being
done, when the signals are being sent primarily

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:59.360
to gain social approval or status, that's
when it becomes virtue signaling rather than

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:02.340
simply expressing an opinion.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:08.550
The right loves to say that it is the left
that predominantly engages in virtue signaling.

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:13.030
But much like the right likes to say, the
cancel culture is on the left.

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:16.900
When the cancel culture is actually on the
right, as we've talked about before.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:22.880
Much like the right likes to say that it is
the left that is engaging in voter fraud,

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.610
but in fact it's mostly happening on the right.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:28.550
It is exactly the same with virtue signaling.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:33.030
Let's talk about how the right engages in
virtue signaling.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:38.690
Conservatives might display American flags
or say, I support the military in order to

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:43.810
signal that they are patriotic and to gain
approval from their peers.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:49.070
In many cases, they don't really care about
either, but they are using those symbols,

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:55.260
support the troops, stickers, whatever, to
signal that they are on the right team when

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:56.819
it comes to those issues.

00:02:56.819 --> 00:03:01.680
Or they might say, we've got to stop this
cancel culture from the left.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:09.110
The left wing, I'm for free speech because
they want to appear to be defending values

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:13.620
that are currently in vogue, even though they
neither care nor understand what the hell

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:16.760
they're talking about, nor whose speech is
being limited.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:22.620
Blue Lives Matter stickers or paraphernalia
or whatever to show we support law enforcement

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:23.620
in the military.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.700
They might not even really care or understand
what's going on with law enforcement or the

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:32.870
military when they use phrases like, I support
traditional values.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:36.019
I am about real America.

00:03:36.019 --> 00:03:40.540
You're talking about signaling that you support
conservative cultural norms.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:45.430
Now we're slowly starting to get over to dog
whistles, which I will get to in a moment.

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:50.640
Other examples of right wing virtue signaling
include posting on social media about how

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.520
you want border security.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.130
We have to have a border.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:04:00.450
When you live in Iowa doesn't mean you can't
care about immigration when you live in Iowa.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:06.120
But for many of these folks, it is a form
of virtue signaling, sometimes expressing

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:12.270
religious beliefs or even going to church
to be seen at church can all be examples of

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.080
right wing virtue signaling.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:17.049
But and this is where we start getting into
dog whistles.

00:04:17.049 --> 00:04:19.919
Virtue signaling and dog whistles are two
different things.

00:04:19.919 --> 00:04:24.960
When we talk about dog whistles, we're talking
about coded language or symbols that have

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:30.920
a hidden meaning that is meant to communicate
a particular message to a specific audience.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:37.970
Often there is bigotry or prejudice in dog
whistles, so I'll give you some examples.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:40.759
Different ones are dog whistles to different
degrees.

00:04:40.759 --> 00:04:47.460
When people have been talking about I support
medical freedom during the pandemic, often

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:49.560
what they mean is I'm against vaccines.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:56.039
And so it's a dog whistle more than a virtue
signal in that it is coded if you're not part

00:04:56.039 --> 00:04:57.680
of the discussion.

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:58.680
Medical freedom?

00:04:58.680 --> 00:04:59.680
I don't know.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:00.680
Sounds good.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:01.680
Yeah, sure.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:02.680
Why not?

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:06.780
But it is often a dog whistle for anti-vaccine,
talking about often the word urban, particularly

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:12.370
talking about like gun violence needs to be
dealt with for what it is an urban problem.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:14.370
There talk about black people.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:22.419
So urban in certain contexts is a is a dog
whistle for black and or brown people.

00:05:22.419 --> 00:05:27.169
Sometimes law and order can be a dog whistle
where you're sort of saying, well, I'm tough,

00:05:27.169 --> 00:05:28.889
tough on crime.

00:05:28.889 --> 00:05:34.360
But law and order is also often used as a
dog whistle to support racially biased policies

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:37.620
like, for example, stop and frisk.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:42.270
America first is sometimes a dog whistle to
white nationalists and others.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:48.680
States rights is one that's been used by politicians
to support policies that discriminate against

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:49.680
minorities.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:50.780
Roll back civil rights.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.990
States rights has been used as a dog whistle
up to and including support of slavery, quite

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:57.940
literally when they talk about the Civil War.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:01.789
Globalist can be a dog whistle for Jews.

00:06:01.789 --> 00:06:04.560
We've talked about that one extensively before.

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:10.350
So both virtue signaling and dog whistling
involve sending a message to a particular

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.360
audience.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:17.270
The difference is the virtue signaling is
more about gaining approval, whereas the dog

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:22.389
whistling is more about communicating a hidden
message to those who understand the term.

00:06:22.389 --> 00:06:26.599
So both important terms to understand.

00:06:26.599 --> 00:06:30.750
When I use them in the future, hopefully they
will now be more clear.

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:35.910
Let me know what you think of my missing examples
of either that are relevant.

